## 中文

本仓库中的 Skill、Prompt、工作流设计、文档及相关原创内容仅供个人学习、研究与非商业用途使用。

如果你希望将本仓库中的 Skill 用于任何商业用途，包括但不限于：

- 商业产品或服务；
- 付费项目或客户项目；
- 企业内部商业应用；
- 商业化 AI Agent 或工作流；
- 付费课程、社群或知识产品；
- 基于本 Skill 修改、包装后进行商业分发。

请在使用前与版权所有者联系并获得授权。

**未经授权，请勿将本仓库内容直接或修改后用于商业用途、出售、重新授权或作为商业产品的一部分进行分发。**

如果你在个人项目、研究项目、开源项目或社交媒体中使用了这些 Skill，欢迎分享你的成果。如方便，也欢迎注明来源并 @我：[@AM.]。

## English

The Skills, prompts, workflow designs, documentation, and related original content in this repository are licensed solely for personal learning, research, and other non-commercial use.

If you wish to use any Skill in this repository for a commercial purpose, including but not limited to:

- commercial products or services;
- paid projects or client work;
- internal commercial use within an organization;
- commercial AI agents or workflows;
- paid courses, communities, or knowledge products; or
- commercial distribution of a modified or repackaged version of a Skill,

contact the copyright holder and obtain authorization before use.

**Without authorization, do not use, sell, sublicense, or distribute any repository content, whether unchanged or modified, for commercial purposes or as part of a commercial product.**

If you use these Skills in a personal project, research project, open-source project, or social-media post, sharing your results is welcome. When convenient, please credit the source and tag [@AM.].
